  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "As VRChat will know exact birth date of each verified user, why not to make an option to fully or partially show this information in the profile?\n\nOptions might be:\n\n- Don't show at all (obvious privacy, default)\n\n- Show only day and month (no year, some ppl would like to hide their age, only exposing they are 18+)\n\n- Show only month (some ppl are not really comfortable to expose the day)\n\n- Show only year/age (some ppl are OK to expose age, but not bday)\n\n- Show only month and year (it's like two prev options combined)\n\n- Show full day, month and year (those people don't fear anything lol)\n\nSounds a bit complicated but it can be implemented simply as 3 toggles for each part:\n\n- day\n\n- month\n\n- year+age",
